    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A cello line that crosses into the treble staff and back. The clef change" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// is the one context change that is not a barline event: it happens where the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// player's hand arrives, in the middle of a measure, and the engraver draws a" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// small clef before the note it affects." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// It is also the one context change that is a *part's* business — no key or" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// meter written elsewhere reaches it — which is why it is scoped to the part" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// and the others are scoped to the piece." },
